---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Organize by thought" description="Mapflowy is a calm, keyboard-first way to map projects and ideas.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">A map for your mind</p>
      <h1>Projects,<br />arranged by thought.</h1>
      <p>Mapflowy gives every idea room to grow. Start with a simple map, move through it with your keyboard, and open any element to organize the next level.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="primary-button" href="/">Open the organizer</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" role="img" aria-label="Abstract organizer map with a Projects node"></div>
  </section>
  <section class="feature-grid" aria-label="Product benefits">
    <article class="feature"><h3>See the shape of work</h3><p>A visual layout keeps the relationships between projects, tasks, and ideas in view.</p></article>
    <article class="feature"><h3>Stay in the flow</h3><p>Create, open, move, and remove elements without reaching for a mouse.</p></article>
    <article class="feature"><h3>Keep your hierarchy</h3><p>Use Map and Text views when you want an exact outline of everything you have made.</p></article>
  </section>
  <section class="local-note" aria-labelledby="local-storage-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Local by design</p><h2 id="local-storage-title">Your maps stay in your browser.</h2>
    <p>Changes are saved automatically on this device. There is no account or cross-device sync, and clearing this site's browser data will remove your saved maps.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="shortcut-panel" aria-labelledby="shortcuts-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Keyboard-first by design</p><h2 id="shortcuts-title">Your hands already know the way.</h2>
    <div class="shortcuts"><span><kbd>A</kbd> Add</span><span><kbd>E</kbd> Edit</span><span><kbd>↑ ↓ ← →</kbd> Move</span><span><kbd>Enter</kbd> Open / add</span><span><kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>Enter</kbd> Back</span><span><kbd>Delete</kbd> Remove</span><span><kbd>G</kbd> Map view</span><span><kbd>F</kbd> Text view</span><span><kbd>Tab</kbd> Indent</span><span><kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>Tab</kbd> Outdent</span></div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
